  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_615275_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_838803_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/lexicon?logo=modrinth&amp;label=&amp;suffix= &amp;style=flat&amp;color=242629&amp;labelColor=5ca424&amp;logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/615275(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Поддерживаемые версии\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat&amp;label=&amp;labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"логотип\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📖 Описание</h2><p>Этот мод добавляет в игру лексикон, который объясняет почти каждый аспект Minecraft в игре! От вашей первой ночи до описаний всех монстров, схем редстоуна, советов, хитростей, пивоварения, заклинаний, команд и даже как завершить игру!</p><p>Полезно для всех новичков и игроков, которые хотят расширить свои знания об игре, не обращаясь снова и снова к интернету...</p><hr><h3>Особенности:</h3><ul>\n<li>внутриигровая вики</li>\n<li>использует <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a> в качестве базы</li>\n<li>проверка обновлений</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>📷 Презентация</h2><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EHckbE2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SQHv9XD.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4mrqFRm.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k0mzncT.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ErHi32t.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j1D6xsJ.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ovz9Udb.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lCySCJo.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yKNXhKM.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9MdwsIx.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ByxM5ph.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2apkK7R.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JCDPLnY.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6gBIZEw.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🗃️ Зависимости</h2><h3><strong>Требуемые:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>Magma Core</strong> [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n<ul>\n<li>Предоставляет базовый код и функции, такие как проверка обновлений</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmagma-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><strong>GuideME</strong> [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n<ul>\n<li>Обеспечивает базу лексикона</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guideme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fguideme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Patchouli</strong> [≤ MC 1.21.4]\n<ul>\n<li>Обеспечивает базу лексикона</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmods%252fpatchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"></p><h2>🎮 Другие мои моды!</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Additional Structures\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bedrock Miner\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Tool Upgrades\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"All The Compatibility\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Customized Dungeon Loot\" width=\"85\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-